#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Our Story"
msgstr "ታሪካችን"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Abbabal started as a simple idea: What if thousands of Amharic proverbs, scattered in notebooks, books, and conversations, could live in one open place — for everyone to read, learn, and build with?"
msgstr "አበባል እንደ ቀላል ሀሳብ ተጀመረ፡ በማስታወሻ ደብተሮች፣ መጽሐፎች እና ውይይቶች ውስጥ የተበተኑ ሺዎች የአማርኛ ምሳሌዎች በአንድ ክፍት ቦታ ቢኖሩ — ሁሉም ሰው እንዲያነብ፣ እንዲማር እና እንዲጠቀምባቸው?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "We gathered proverbs from many sources, verified them carefully, and paired each one with clear interpretations. Then we built the tools — a website, an API, and a mobile app — to make this wisdom easy to access and use."
msgstr "ምሳሌዎችን ከብዙ ምንጮች ሰብስበን፣ በጥንቃቄ አረጋገጥን፣ እና እያንዳንዱን ከግልጽ ትርጓሜዎች ጋር አጣመርን። ከዚያም ይህን ጥበብ በቀላሉ ለማግኘት እና ለመጠቀም መሳሪያዎቹን ገነባን።"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Today, Abbabal is an open platform for learning, research, and creativity."
msgstr "ዛሬ፣ አበባል ለትምህርት፣ ለምርምር እና ለፈጠራ ክፍት መድረክ ነው።"

